abstract: >-
  Reproducible research combining source review, controlled wallet
  observations, financial-correlation demonstrations and disclosure analysis.
  Includes dated public-response analysis, default-risk decisions and ecosystem
  accountability questions. Experimental scope, attributed statements and
  unsupported claims are recorded separately in the claim ledger.
